#: ../../c-api/sentinel.rst:6
msgid "Sentinel objects"
msgstr "哨兵对象"

#: ../../c-api/sentinel.rst:10
msgid ""
"This instance of :c:type:`PyTypeObject` represents the Python "
":class:`sentinel` type.  This is the same object as :class:`sentinel`."
msgstr ""
"此 :c:type:`PyTypeObject` 实例代表 Python 的 :class:`sentinel` 类型。该对象与 "
":class:`sentinel` 为同一对象。"

#: ../../c-api/sentinel.rst:17
msgid ""
"Return true if *o* is a :class:`sentinel` object or a subtype. The "
":class:`sentinel` type does not currently allow subclasses, so this check is"
" exact. Future Python versions may choose to allow subtyping. This function "
"always succeeds."
msgstr ""
"如果 *o* 是 :class:`sentinel` 对象或其子类，则返回 true。:class:`sentinel` "
"类型目前不允许子类，因此此检查是严格匹配的；未来的 Python 版本可能会选择允许子类化。此函数始终会成功返回。"

#: ../../c-api/sentinel.rst:27
msgid ""
"Return true if *o* is a :class:`sentinel` object, but not a subtype. The "
":class:`sentinel` type does not currently allow subclasses. Future Python "
"versions may choose to allow subtyping. This function always succeeds."
msgstr ""
"如果 *o* 是 :class:`sentinel` 对象但并非其子类，则返回 true。目前 :class:`sentinel` "
"类型不允许子类；未来的 Python 版本可能会选择允许子类化。此函数始终成功。"

#: ../../c-api/sentinel.rst:36
msgid ""
"Return a new :class:`sentinel` object with :attr:`~sentinel.__name__` set to"
" *name* and :attr:`~sentinel.__module__` set to *module_name*. *name* must "
"not be ``NULL``. If *module_name* is ``NULL``, :attr:`~sentinel.__module__` "
"is set to ``None``. If *repr* is ``NULL``, ``repr()`` returns "
":attr:`~sentinel.__name__`. Return ``NULL`` with an exception set on "
"failure."
msgstr ""
"返回一个新的 :class:`sentinel` 对象，其中 :attr:`~sentinel.__name__` 设置为 "
"*name*，:attr:`~sentinel.__module__` 设置为 *module_name*。*name* 不得为 ``NULL``。如果"
" *module_name* 为 ``NULL``，则 :attr:`~sentinel.__module__` 被设置为 ``None``。如果 "
"*repr* 为 ``NULL``，则 ``repr()`` 返回 :attr:`~sentinel.__name__`。若操作失败，则返回 "
"``NULL`` 并抛出异常。"

#: ../../c-api/sentinel.rst:42
msgid ""
"For pickling to work, *module_name* must be the name of an importable "
"module, and the sentinel must be accessible from that module under a path "
"matching *name*.  Pickle treats *name* as a global variable name in "
"*module_name* (see :meth:`object.__reduce__`)."
msgstr ""
"要使 pickle 正常工作，*module_name* 必须是可导入模块的名称，且哨兵变量必须能够通过与 *name* "
"相匹配的路径从该模块中访问到。Pickle 会将 *name* 视为 *module_name* 中的全局变量名称（参见 "
":meth:`object.__reduce__`）。"
